:26:43","source":"Zee Business"},{"id":"794422768934539392","title":"Godfrey Phillips shares fell 8%, the largest drop in 5 months.\nThe decline followed the cigarette excise duty notification.","summary":"Godfrey Phillips shares fell 8%, the largest drop in 5 months.\nThe decline followed the cigarette excise duty notification.","url":"https://sqst.in/shareMessage?msgId=794422768934539386","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-01T10:02:27","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"423249","title":"The Centre imposes excise duty on cigarettes from Feb 1, ranging Rs 2,050–8,500 per 1,000 sticks.\nTaxes on cigarettes now total 53%, impacting firms like ITC and Godfrey Phillips India.","summary":"The Centre imposes excise duty on cigarettes from Feb 1, ranging Rs 2,050–8,500 per 1,000 sticks.\nTaxes on cigarettes now total 53%, impacting firms like ITC and Godfrey Phillips India.","url":"https://www.cnbctv18.com/india/cigarette-tax-centre-imposes-excise-duty-effective-february-1-19810953.htm","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-01T07:35:29","source":"CNBC TV 18"},{"id":"260101123317334","title":"Excise duty hike on cigarettes is negative for ITC in the near term, says Jefferies.\nJefferies warns of volume and earnings hit but maintains positive stance on ITC.","summary":"Excise duty hike on cigarettes is negative for ITC in the near term, says Jefferies.\nJefferies warns of volume and earnings hit but maintains positive stance on ITC.","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/what-cigarette-tax-hike-means-for-37-lakh-itc-shareholders-jefferies-explains/articleshow/126285073.cms","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-01T00:00:00","source":"The Economic Times"},{"id":"420144","title":"Godfrey Phillips filed a ₹344.5 crore insurance claim after a fire at a third-party Andhra Pradesh facility, with no impact on its production or financials.\nShares of Godfrey Phillips traded at ₹2,848, down 0.86%, with intraday highs of ₹2,903.7 and lows of ₹2,837.4 on NSE.","summary":